.TH ARIF_RL_DISABLE 3 "Aug 03, 2025" 0.2.0 "ARIF User Manual"
.
.SH NAME
arif_rl_disable - stop using Readline for ARIF
.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.EX
.B #include <arif_rl.h>
.PP
.B void
.B arif_rl_disable (void);
.EE
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR arif_rl_disable ()
function disables using Readline as an ARIF frontend, by restoring
Readline completion variables to their original values before
.BR arif_rl_enable (3)
was called.
.PP
If already disabled, function behavior is undefined.
.
